{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>《香港小姐競選2026》昨日（8月30日）圓滿結束，冠、亞、季分別由袁絲珩、鄧匡閔與李澤欣奪得。整場騷在穩陣與平淡的節奏下進行，跟往年的環節沒有太大突破，不過過程中卻有一段小插曲引起網民熱議，令郭柏妍的人品被激讚！</p><figure><img alt=\"郭柏妍獲激讚。（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260831/1171065856126357504418902.jpeg/RVMtmeMHUx9KIzZ2S-o5_it8EeF2fhY1aEWRUF5FkVA\"/><figcaption>郭柏妍獲激讚。（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><p>謝淑怡成個人仆在台上</p><p>節目中安排了梁漢文帶領三位前港姐，陳楨怡、郭柏妍與謝淑怡以歌曲做一個音樂短劇，前港姐「鋼琴才女」謝淑怡負責彈琴。當各人完成一系烈精彩的表演後，準備走到台前謝幕，謝淑怡不慎發生失足意外，整個人重重仆在台上，剛好進入鏡頭左下角，場面一度相當尷尬。幸好已走到台前的郭柏妍反應神速，即時好心上前將她扶起，獲網民大讚人美心善！</p><figure><img alt=\"謝淑怡表演彈琴。（節目截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260831/1171065117740240896594312.jpeg/nsQm2bzQIWHiw3vQj2fOu4fK3SNZnxnEEJ5vPhCebz4\"/><figcaption>謝淑怡表演彈琴。（節目截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"表演完畢大家到台前謝幕。（節目截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260831/1171065115500351488516843.jpeg/xDT_nDrfXDgCY5R-8D03RiJNtYWYn2_04rCqleKwqpU\"/><figcaption>表演完畢大家到台前謝幕。（節目截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"謝淑怡突然在左下角仆入鏡。（節目截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260831/1171065128691961856715820.jpeg/XbKlUwFVx9kRKrIie-C47UgPDqhGETYEzdd50s3XedI\"/><figcaption>謝淑怡突然在左下角仆入鏡。（節目截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好慘，睇見都痛。（節目截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260831/1171065126577901568269507.jpeg/c38mVKkVRLT7kI5BDXiNk980dFjxWcOhlDhGjZQ4Ro0\"/><figcaption>好慘，睇見都痛。（節目截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好慘，睇見都痛。（節目截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260831/1171065124367372288913825.jpeg/At4-61mbiRWgLhLSuPMDb1d6QxvUMn6LBSaWswUmlrM\"/><figcaption>好慘，睇見都痛。（節目截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好慘，睇見都痛。（節目截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260831/1171065122219757568475231.jpeg/ny9P1FGfBi_-HINTQZ2gN6YejqyvvAWRq5stPqubLT4\"/><figcaption>好慘，睇見都痛。（節目截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"郭柏妍上前扶起。（節目截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260831/1171065120030199808642397.jpeg/z2lHrLk5m_Whl_e0a81qTbeECy51VRHay5UoGcuVKBk\"/><figcaption>郭柏妍上前扶起。（節目截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"郭柏妍上前扶起。（節目截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260831/1171065636638429184580729.jpeg/i87nSSh72fsP_R9bDAqJGODiNNGvnlMDIMG-MiDBvjI\"/><figcaption>郭柏妍上前扶起。（節目截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-31T04:38:42.198201+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":420,"images":9,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}